---
layout: changelog
title: "AACSearch Sites now supports TanStack Start"
date: 2025-10-28
cover: /images/blog/tanstack-start-support-in-aacsearch-sites/cover.png
---
[TanStack Start](https://tanstack.com/start/latest) is quickly becoming the go-to framework for developers who want simplicity, type safety, and performance without the overhead. 

And now, AACSearch Sites brings full **Server-Side Rendering (SSR)** support for TanStack Start, making it easier to build, run, and deploy modern React and Solid apps on AACSearch Cloud.

# What’s new

- **Full SSR support for TanStack Start**: Deploy TanStack Start apps directly on AACSearch Cloud with zero configuration.
- **Native Cloud support**: Everything works out of the box on AACSearch Cloud, no additional setup required.

It’s now available on AACSearch Cloud.

